`,e.jsxs(a.p,{children:["Primary sources: ",e.jsx(a.a,{href:"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.02648v1",children:"paper v1, April 3, 2026"}),", ",e.jsxs(a.a,{href:"https://github.com/camel-ai/GBQA/tree/ca7e3fb652a2e4826d0f14392a9a390522a1f1a7",children:["paper-era repository snapshot ",e.jsx(a.code,{children:"ca7e3fb"})]}),", and ",e.jsxs(a.a,{href:"https://github.com/camel-ai/GBQA/tree/500e5ea252ee7afccc275b0e28fbd6de8c8f5dfc",children:["later revision ",e.jsx(a.code,{children:"500e5ea"})]}),". The historical README uses the paper's exact title and matching research description; the author-associated ",e.jsx(a.a,{href:"https://huggingface.co/papers/2604.02648",children:"paper page"})," links this repository. These establish project linkage, not equivalence between the paper experiment and either inspected revision. Read-only source review; no game, model, container or evaluator was run."]}),`
